<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/identify-risk-factors-for-hypoglycaemia> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Identify risk factors for hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "identify-risk-factors-for-hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "Identify the risk factors for hypoglycaemia (see Table 2)." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "When hypoglycaemia has been successfully treated  \n(after following the initial steps outlined in algorithms A-E) \n\nl\t Consider completing an incident form (e.g. DATIX) if appropriate. \nl\t If “hypo boxes” have been used then restock as appropriate. \nl\t Identify the risk factors for hypoglycaemia (see Table 2)." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_01_hypo_guideline_with_qr_code_january_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/immediate-management-of-unconscious-or-seizure-prone-adults-with-hypoglycaemia> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Immediate Management of Unconscious or Seizure-Prone Adults with Hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:populationScope "Adults who are unconscious and/or having seizures and/or are very aggressive" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "immediate-management-of-unconscious-or-seizure-prone-adults-with-hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Check: a. Airway (and give oxygen) b. Breathing c. Circulation d. Disability (including Glasgow Coma Scale (GCS) and blood glucose) e. Exposure (including temperature)" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "1. Check: a. Airway (and give oxygen) b. Breathing c. Circulation d. Disability (including Glasgow Coma Scale (GCS) and blood glucose) e. Exposure (including temperature)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_01_hypo_guideline_with_qr_code_january_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/immediate-treatment-of-hypoglycaemia> a dmo:Recommendation ;
