    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "The glycaemic target should be adjusted according to the person’s individual circumstances; a frail, elderly person with multiple comorbidities may benefit from less stringent glycaemic control." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "It is important to emphasise the glycaemic target should be adjusted according to the person’s individual circumstances; a frail, elderly person with multiple comorbidities may benefit from less stringent glycaemic control." ;
