    dmo:evidenceQuote "When hypoglycaemia has been successfully treated  \n(after following the initial steps outlined in algorithms A-E) \n\nl\t Consider completing an incident form (e.g. DATIX) if appropriate. \nl\t If “hypo boxes” have been used then restock as appropriate." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_01_hypo_guideline_with_qr_code_january_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/review-diabetes-treatment-after-hypoglycaemia> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Review diabetes treatment after hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:populationScope "People experiencing hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "review-diabetes-treatment-after-hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "This should also trigger a review of diabetes treatment to see if any adjustment is necessary." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "This should also trigger a review of diabetes treatment to see if any adjustment is necessary." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_01_hypo_guideline_with_qr_code_january_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/review-insulin-regimen-after-hypoglycaemia> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Review insulin regimen after hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "review-insulin-regimen-after-hypoglycaemia" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "However, consideration will have to be given as to which insulin dose was active at the time of the hypoglycaemic episode and so a review of their insulin regimen is likely to be required." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "7. DO NOT omit insulin injection if due. The insulin injection about to be given is \nunlikely to be the insulin dose that was active at the time of the hypoglycaemia episode \nand so should not be omitted.  However, consideration will have to be given as to which \ninsulin dose was active at the time of the hypoglycaemic episode and so a review of their \ninsulin regimen is likely to be required." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_01_hypo_guideline_with_qr_code_january_2023> .

